# Patch 'curated-shanks' (triples REMOVED from the upstream data before reasoning/import). Hand-written, not generated.
# The wiki infobox of Shanks mixes in Figarland-family data: he does not live in Mary Geoise and is not a Knight of God / Devoted Blade of God.
# A player thinking of Shanks answers "no" to these, and a recorded-but-wrong TRUE cost him the game (found by playing him by hand).
@prefix op: <http://kalnassag.com/onepiece#> .

op:Shanks op:residence op:Mary_Geoise ;
    op:affiliatesWith op:Knights_of_God ;
    op:occupation op:Devoted_Blade_of_God .
